Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:07.70,Sub,I was born in 1998, in Leka Dulecha,\NEast Wollega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:14.70,Sub,My father, Bulti Firissa, is a teacher\Nof geography and history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:21.70,Sub,From him, I learned where we come from,\Nand how the world connects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:35.70,Sub,I went to Addis Ababa to study software\Nengineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:42.70,Sub,My father mapped the land. I learned to\Nmap systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:49.70,Sub,Today I build banking systems at\NCooperative Bank of Oromia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:56.70,Sub,So that families like mine can send\Nmoney home in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:13.70,Sub,My father taught the history of our\Nland. I hope to help write its future.
